{#- Language switch (REQ-010): one link to the same page in the other
    language, named in the target language ("Svenska" on English pages,
    "English" on Swedish pages). `languageSwitch` (src.11tydata.js) is the
    counterpart, or for an English article without a Swedish file the Swedish
    page that shows it in English, and from that page the English one (D206).
    Absent on pages without a counterpart (404).
    Whitespace control: the header includes this with `{%- include %}` so a
    page without alternate leaves no blank line. -#}
{%- if languageSwitch %}
    <a class="lang-switch" href="{{ languageSwitch.url }}" hreflang="{{ languageSwitch.lang }}" lang="{{ languageSwitch.lang }}" rel="alternate">{{ strings[lang].languages[languageSwitch.lang] }}</a>
{%- endif %}
